    "3-Journal/2025/2025-07/2025-07-20.md": [
      {
        "id": "bbuebt748",
        "text": "\n> [!Quote]  Quote of the Day\n> See a lot of y'all don't understand Kendrick Lamar  \nBecause you wonder how I could talk about money, hoes, clothes, God and history  \nAll in the same sentence  \nYou know what all them things have in common?  \nOnly half of the truth if you tell it  \nSee I spent twenty-three years on this earth searching for answers\n> Till one day I realised I had to come up with my own  \nI'm not on the outside looking in, I'm not on inside looking out  \nI'm in the dead fucking centre looking around\n> — Kendrick Lamar, Ab-Souls Outro\n> ",
        "tags": [],
        "line": 10,
        "startOffset": 142,
        "endOffset": 702,
        "filePath": "3-Journal/2025/2025-07/2025-07-20.md",
        "footnoteCount": 1,
        "footnoteContents": [
          "\n> [!Quote]  Quote of the Day\n> See a lot of y'all don't understand Kendrick Lamar  \nBecause you wonder how I could talk about money, hoes, clothes, God and history  \nAll in the same sentence  \nYou know what all them things have in common?  \nOnly half of the truth if you tell it  \nSee I spent twenty-three years on this earth searching for answers\n> Till one day I realised I had to come up with my own  \nI'm not on the outside looking in, I'm not on inside looking out  \nI'm in the dead fucking centre looking around\n> — Kendrick Lamar, Ab-Souls Outro\n> "
        ],
        "createdAt": 1759096219902,
        "isNativeComment": true,
        "type": "comment"
      }
    ],
    "3-Journal/2025/2025-07/2025-07-19.md": [
      {
        "id": "rvi0ton4f",
        "text": "\n> [!Quote]  Quote of the Day\n>\n>At the end of the day I don't think worldbuilding  is about being the most original, it's about being intentional, being deliberate with what  you create and what you choose to include in a world. Borrow from what moves you and  build upon what resonates, but shape it into something undeniably yours. Infuse it with  your own voice, your own vision. That way, when others step into your world, they won’t just see  echoes of the past, they’ll find something fresh, something that sparks their own imagination.  And perhaps, in turn, they’ll take a piece of it and use it to create something newer still.\n> — Rick's Creations [I Reimagined Elves...](https://youtu.be/VZIwWawhSdI?t=1372)\n",
        "tags": [],
        "line": 9,
        "startOffset": 126,
        "endOffset": 850,
        "filePath": "3-Journal/2025/2025-07/2025-07-19.md",
        "footnoteCount": 1,
        "footnoteContents": [
          "\n> [!Quote]  Quote of the Day\n>\n>At the end of the day I don't think worldbuilding  is about being the most original, it's about being intentional, being deliberate with what  you create and what you choose to include in a world. Borrow from what moves you and  build upon what resonates, but shape it into something undeniably yours. Infuse it with  your own voice, your own vision. That way, when others step into your world, they won’t just see  echoes of the past, they’ll find something fresh, something that sparks their own imagination.  And perhaps, in turn, they’ll take a piece of it and use it to create something newer still.\n> — Rick's Creations [I Reimagined Elves...](https://youtu.be/VZIwWawhSdI?t=1372)\n"
        ],
        "createdAt": 1759096219886,
        "isNativeComment": true,
        "type": "comment"
      }
    ],
